      <description>&lt;p&gt;Thanks for looking into this post! After this &lt;a href=&#34;https://frankyudang.github.io/posts/post2&#34;&gt;post&lt;/a&gt;,  &lt;a href=&#34;https://frankyudang.github.io/posts/2025/05/hugo-tutorial-part-i/&#34;&gt;post&lt;/a&gt; I continue to add more features to my websites. I check out this &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZFL09qhKi5I&#34;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;  by Luke Smith. Below I will show you some key points I learned.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-how-to-add-reference-in-the-post&#34;&gt;1 How to add reference in the post?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;post&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;](&lt;/span&gt;/posts/post2&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;post&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;](&lt;/span&gt;**&amp;lt; relref &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;post2.md&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;gt;**&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# replace ** with {{ }}&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;video&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;](&lt;/span&gt;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;ZFL09qhKi5I&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;2-how-to-insert-image&#34;&gt;2 How to insert image&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The image should added to the folder location &lt;code&gt;/your-web-site-name/static/&lt;/code&gt; . Notice there should &lt;code&gt;style.css&lt;/code&gt; in the folder too. Below command should be used to add the &lt;code&gt;style.css&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
